  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>WF-load_vocabulary
Loads the 9 Athena vocabulary files from ${VOCAB_DIR} into the OMOP vocabulary tables (bulk load).
Run it once after WF-create_tables, and again only for a new vocabulary version.
First empties the vocabulary tables. Their CASCADE also empties the clinical CDM tables:
run WF-load_all afterwards. CONCEPT.csv must contain concept_id 0 (a full Athena download does).</note>
      <markdown>N</markdown>
